%description:
Tests that the persist timer does not change the RTO. The server offers 2000
bytes and reads nothing until t=20, so its window is zero after two segments,
and the client probes the window. The persist intervals follow their table
(5, 5, 6, 12 s), and the RTO of the client stays its measured value: the
first retransmission of a probe octet doubles it from 1 s. The persist timer
wrote its limit of 5 s into the RTO.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 40s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 5000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 2000
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="20 10000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[6.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2002(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[6.411 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[7.409 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2002(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[7.411 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[9.409 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2002(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[9.411 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[9.413 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2002(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[9.415 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
[11.409 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2002:2003(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[11.411 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
increasing RTO from 1s  to 2s
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
